post-it: Can't open images
symptoms:
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
checks:
	"Cannot find the file" when opening a picture
		shows: "Cannot find the file 'C:\WINDOWS\PBRUSH.EXE' (or one of its components)"
	Programs in C:\WINDOWS lost their .EXE
		shows: NOTEPAD, WORDPAD, PBRUSH, CALC and others
software steps:
	Open C:\WINDOWS
	Rename each program that lost its .EXE back to its name with .EXE
